# Handoff Maintenance

- Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/handoffs/MASTER_HANDOFF.md`, `docs/handoffs/REPOSITORY.md`, the active index, and current branch handoff/history before work.
- Verify handoff claims against git.
- After every agent change, update the affected active handoff and index.
- Append per-branch history for meaningful milestones only; never rewrite older entries.
- Keep every handoff/history Markdown file strictly below 42,000 characters.
- Run `python scripts/validate_handoffs.py` after handoff changes.
- Before every PR, propose checks and ask the owner to approve or revise them.
- After merge/pull, archive handoff/history, append global HISTORY, refresh the index, and delete reachable merged branches.

